{"ID":"20240504161429-sad4g53","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161429-sad4g53","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161429-sad4g53\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620132041-gc8529u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617092356-wfxc10h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607135908-adpxosl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"092牡桂（桂、桂枝、肉桂、桂心）","type":"doc","updated":"20240808165030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240620132041-gc8529u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620132041-gc8529u","updated":"20240620132043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝"}]},{"ID":"20240715124314-sz4wh64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124314-sz4wh64","updated":"20240715124314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于福建、广东、广西等地。\n【性状】\t呈长圆柱形，多分枝，长3075cm，粗端直径0.31cm。表面红棕色至棕色，有纵棱线、细皱纹及小疙瘩状的叶痕、枝痕、芽痕，皮孔点状。质硬而脆，易折断。切片厚2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm，断面皮部红棕色，木部黄白色至浅黄棕色，髓部略呈方形。有特异香气，味甜、微辛，皮部味较浓。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，温。\n【功效】\t发汗解肌，温通经脉，助阳化气，平冲降气。用于风寒感冒，脘腹冷痛，血寒经闭，关节痹痛，痰饮，水肿，心悸，奔豚。"}]},{"ID":"20240715124314-jpr25sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124314-jpr25sx","updated":"20240715124314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113544-d0wu21o.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715124314-4doiccm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124314-4doiccm","updated":"20240715124314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桂枝"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桂枝-20240205155047-jtogila.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620131225-8xlho4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620131225-8xlho4o","updated":"20240620131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 364px;","style":"width: 354px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620131225-3m2l4tq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 354px;\" parent-style=\"width: 364px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240620132045-pc2xwqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620132045-pc2xwqn","updated":"20240620132047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉桂"}]},{"ID":"20240715124338-rypcuby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124338-rypcuby","updated":"20240715124338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、福建、海南等地。\n【性状】\t企边桂：呈长片状槽状形，左右两边向内卷曲，卷边呈半筒形，槽的中心略凸起，外皮下凹，长43cm左右，宽46cm，外皮棕灰白色或棕褐色，两端各有5mm削去栓皮的斜面呈棕色。全体有不规则的横生皮孔和多数微突起的小瘤点。偶有略突起的横纹及灰绿色花纹 (苔藓类植物着生后留下的痕迹，俗称彩皮) 。内表面暗红棕色或棕色，光洁，用指甲刮划时可见深棕色油纹。气芳香浓烈，味甜辣。板桂：呈板片状，两边稍向内弯曲，长43cm，宽1315cm，厚0.6cm，外皮粗糙，灰褐色；内皮暗紫色，断面油层棕褐色，外层棕红色，一般油少渣多，香气及甜辣味较淡。\n油桂：呈半边竹筒状槽形，两端略呈斜面，长43cm，外表呈灰棕色或棕褐色，常有灰绿色花斑 (彩皮)，内表皮暗棕色，质硬而脆，断面内层油层集中分明，稍有光泽，黑色或棕褐色，外层紫红色，气味浓烈，味甜辛。\n桂通：呈双圆筒形或圆筒形，长35cm，厚0.1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.3cm，外表灰棕色，有细皱纹及小裂，皮孔椭圆形，偶有凸起横纹及灰色花纹。内表皮暗棕色。质硬而脆，断面紫红色或棕红色，气香，味甜辣。又名“桂皮”、“桂尔通”。\n桂心：形态与桂通相同，只是外表的栓皮层已被刮除干净，内外皮均呈棕黄色。\n桂碎：大小不规则片块状或短卷筒状，外皮灰棕色，断面和内皮呈棕色或棕褐色，气香，味甜辣。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，大热。\n【功效】\t补火助阳，引火归源，散寒止痛，活血通经。暖脾胃，除积冷，通血脉。治命门火衰，肢冷脉微，亡阳虚脱，腹痛泄泻，寒疝奔豚，腰膝冷痛，经闭症瘕，阴疽，流注，及虚阳浮越，上热下寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240715124338-8nvnp0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124338-8nvnp0z","updated":"20240715124338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135356-vlo660v.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715124338-ytgs6la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124338-ytgs6la","updated":"20240715124338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉桂"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉桂-20240205161833-342r4ik.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715124338-c9diw1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715124338-c9diw1a","updated":"20240715124338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉桂2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉桂2-20240205161833-ud9bmim.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620133428-kf1xa98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620133428-kf1xa98","updated":"20240620133437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 557px;","style":"width: 547px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620133428-t3jjwbp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 547px;\" parent-style=\"width: 557px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620132049-6eba49c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620132049-6eba49c","updated":"20240620132052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"桂心"}]},{"ID":"20240620131953-0da3mcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620131953-0da3mcr","updated":"20240620132116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620131939-mnddshr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 243px;","style":"width: 233px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620132116-11jjm15.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 233px;\" parent-style=\"width: 243px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808161147-9h4b5m9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240808161147-9h4b5m9"}},{"ID":"20240607135908-adpxosl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135908-adpxosl","updated":"20240620132401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉桂树"}]},{"ID":"20240620132403-61hti4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620132403-61hti4s","updated":"20240808161353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 437px;",